  "texts": {
    "briefing": "The time is ripe. Strike and obliterate the enemy\nbases totally. It has had time to install some\nadditional defences, however, so take care.\n\nWe have developed a new technology which should be\nof some assistance. We call it the warp core.\nTwo have been installed - one to take you to each\nenemy base. Take care in their use as you will\nemerge in highly hostile territory.\n\nGo for it, commander!",
    "success": "You blew the bases into little bits!\n\nAnd you're promoted to serve on a\ncarrier.",
    "failure": "Bummer!"
  },
